    <p class="mt-8 mb-0 font-sans text-xl">Not all those who wander are lost.</p>
    <p class="m-0 font-sans text-xl">
      Get back to <a class="underline-link px-1 text-gray-d" href="/">Home</a> and keep wandering
    </p>
